	(text_box "The RK806S Bucks working in 2 modes\n1- Using Internal DAC: the output voltage are adjustabel programming via I2C/SPI (All bucks support it)\n2- Using External Resistors: the output voltage are fixed (Buck1,2,5,6,9)\n[the equastion V_out = 0.5V × (1 + R1/R2)]\n\nAnd for how the RK3576 work in the first time the answer in:\nOTP(One-Time Programmable) Memory"
